  "question": {
    "text": "<p>In the circuit diagram shown in figure given below, the current flowing through resistance <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>3</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#937;</mi></math>&nbsp;is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></math>. The value of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi></math> is ________.</p><p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/36b746a5-d3e6-4802-8a59-c2928a66370c.png\" style=\"width: 350px; height: 305px;\" /></p>",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "1",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/21a9a65e-e7e8-4aa8-9ff6-1a172e6cc8a0.png\" style=\"width: 340px; height: 338px;\" /></p><p>Let the current flowing through the circuit be&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>I</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></math>&nbsp;in anti-clockwise direction.</p><p>The net resistance is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>R</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#937;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#937;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#937;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#937;</mi></math></p><p>Hence,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>V</mi><mi>R</mi></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>8</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#937;</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></math></p><p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/3ef1396e-103b-463d-9409-38d8b6e4bd44.png\" style=\"width: 380px; height: 240px;\" /></p><p>The current flowing through the&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>3</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#937;</mi></math>&nbsp;resistor is&nbsp;</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mn>6</mn><mrow><mn>6</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></math></p><p>So,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p>",
    "image": null
  },
